    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I've been dreaming about the guerrillas again, Kassandra.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Depressed Man"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#1$1",
        "duration": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "This is the third time you've come to Endymion Temple to ask for a dream reading, Megas.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kassandra"
    },
    {
        "text": "You still dream of that night seven years ago?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kassandra"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2081_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Depressed Man"
    },
    {
        "text": "We hid in the forest on that dark night. The Sargonians surrounded the wood, hunting for us.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Depressed Man"
    },
    {
        "text": "We could not make a sound, let alone risk a light. We had to disassemble our weapons in pitch darkness.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Depressed Man"
    },
    {
        "text": "Screws, springs, Originium components... I tied the parts of my Arts Unit to my clothes and shoes, disguised as accessories.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Depressed Man"
    },
    {
        "text": "The fear had me so cold that I did not notice when an Originium component had cut my palm open. I thought the wet stuff was sweat.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Depressed Man"
    },
    {
        "text": "When the sun rose, we walked past the Sargonians, disguised as lumberjacks from a nearby village, about a dozen in total. We'd be dead if they saw through our disguise.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Depressed Man"
    },
    {
        "text": "They sized us up. For a moment there, I thought the game was up. In my panic, I tripped over a tree root and plunged into the mud, face-first.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Depressed Man"
    },
    {
        "text": "A Sargonian laughed and rapped on my shoulder with the hilt of his sword, disdainfully. But I was happy. I knew we were safe.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Depressed Man"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#4$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kassandra"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2081_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I keep dreaming about it. Do you think...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Depressed Man"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "You want to know if it's a divine revelation?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kassandra"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2081_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Last year, I saw with my own eyes how the heroes spoke their will through you on the Agora.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Depressed Man"
    },
    {
        "text": "You are the speaker of the heroes of Minos, and the only priest in Athenius who can tell a divine revelation from a normal dream.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Depressed Man"
    },
    {
        "text": "If the gods will that I take up arms again, then I will... no matter how much I fear...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Depressed Man"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Please sit down. Your legs are trembling and your face is pale.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kassandra"
    },
    {
        "text": "The heroes of Minos will not force their children back into a nightmare when they have already seen far too much of the horrors of war.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kassandra"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2081_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "You mean...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Depressed Man"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#3$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I think you have misinterpreted the revelation.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kassandra"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wisdom and courage shine upon you and your friends in place of the twin moons who closed their eyes, and delivered you in the morn, just as you woke up from dream to greet the beautiful Athenian dawn...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kassandra"
    },
    {
        "text": "The virtues of the heroes should be praised, but the pain that has lingered for seven years has blinded you to the beautiful fruit that has ripened on the branches of fate...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kassandra"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Pick it, for it is the heroes' blessing upon you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kassandra"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2081_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "A blessing... on an ordinary Minoan like me?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Depressed Man"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#3$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Our gods and heroes were once ordinary Minoans.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kassandra"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2081_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Thank you, Kassandra. I'm beginning to understand...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Depressed Man"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2085_1#1$1",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$path_intro",
        "key": "$path_loop",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "text": "I have come to relieve you, Kassandra.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Acolyte"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#5$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's already time? So many visitors to the temple today.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kassandra"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2085_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "You have so much on your plate, not just with visitors to Endymion Temple, but also acting on behalf of the head priest of Kereseira's First Temple in administrative duties while the position remains vacant.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Acolyte"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#3$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "There's no need to worry about me, Folia. It is my calling to interpret revelation and speak on behalf of the gods.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kassandra"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2085_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "So, you should know better than I do that the man's dream was mundane, not a divine revelation. To use more Columbian words\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Acolyte"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#3$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "He may have post-traumatic stress disorder. I know.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kassandra"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2085_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why didn't you tell him?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Acolyte"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#9$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Divine revelation should be an honor for any Minoan, but there were only shame and fear in his eyes.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kassandra"
    },
    {
        "text": "He wants to receive guidance from the gods, but he fears that the nightmare is truly a revelation that he cannot refuse.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kassandra"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#3$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "If he believes in my interpretation more than he believes in himself, then I have a responsibility... to make his life a little easier, if nothing else.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kassandra"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2085_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Acolyte"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll prepare some herbal tea with a soothing effect for him, and ask a doctor to follow up.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Acolyte"
    },
    {
        "text": "You have the afternoon off, don't you? You should stop spending it on the temple and focus on yourself.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Acolyte"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#3$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Thank you, Folia. You take so much weight off my shoulders.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kassandra"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
