    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#1$1",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#1$2",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#5$2",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm so very sorry, Hek\u00e1demos.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "text": "I dozed off as soon as I reached the hotel. I didn't realize I would make you wait for a full three hours...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "There's no need to worry, Kyr\u00eda Mashayer. Waiting is part of the job for the Astynomos' Grammate\u00fas.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hek\u00e1demos"
    },
    {
        "text": "You still look weak. Are you sure you want to visit the First Temple right now? You can rest a little longer.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hek\u00e1demos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#2$2",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes, I'm sure! If anything will bring me back to full strength right now, it's Kereseira's First Temple!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "text": "I understand the original site of the temple was where Kereseira, the founding hero of Minos, first received divine revelation in the mountains.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "text": "The first temple that she built there became the genesis of Minos.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#10$2",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "When Sargon... invaded Minos, they rebuilt the three great poleis as nomadic cities, but Kereseira's war-torn First Temple remained where it was.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#6$2",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Now, after a century, Athenius is rebuilding this temple, giving me the opportunity to see the historical building in its original form! This is incredibly exciting!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#7$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "You are surprisingly well-versed in Minoan history... and surprisingly honest.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hek\u00e1demos"
    },
    {
        "text": "Unfortunately, the original plans of the First Temple have been lost, and thus cannot be perfectly recreated.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hek\u00e1demos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "However, there's quite a bit of 'classical' tradition in the way that they're building the temple.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hek\u00e1demos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#1$2",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "What do you mean?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "'To revive the Minoan spirit, we must emulate the heroes who built Athenius, and build the temple of our own accord.'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hek\u00e1demos"
    },
    {
        "text": "Before the referendum took place, these words by the original proponent moved everyone's hearts, and the vote on rebuilding the temple passed almost unanimously.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hek\u00e1demos"
    },
    {
        "text": "No engineering blueprint, no staffing. Kereseira's First Temple shall be built through the passion of the Minoan people, and the veneration of the heroes that flows in their veins.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hek\u00e1demos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#9$2",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wow! A living example of the Minoan spontaneousness that has driven so much artistic achievement!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#7$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Thank you. I hope it's completed soon...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hek\u00e1demos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#9$2",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Rebuilding in the classical style... how interesting! The proponent of the rebuilding must be an ambitious hero beloved by the people!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#8$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Uh... how can I describe that Forte lady?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hek\u00e1demos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1482_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Why is he taking so much time to think? Did you ask a question you shouldn't have?)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mio"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#8$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#10$2",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Even if I did, I'm sure Hek\u00e1demos won't mind! He looks so nice, after all. Maybe he's choosing his words carefully, with a Minoan love of poetry.)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#1$2",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Uh...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#10$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Give me three seconds, Kyr\u00eda Mashayer.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hek\u00e1demos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#5$2",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "O-Okay.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#8$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Three, two, one...",
        "tag": "multiline",
        "name": "Hek\u00e1demos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Alright!",
        "tag": "multiline",
        "name": "Hek\u00e1demos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#1$2",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "You've thought of the answer?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, it's now five o'clock, and my shift is over.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hek\u00e1demos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#5$2",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Huh?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#7$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll answer your question tomorrow, when I'm back at work. Enjoy your visit.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hek\u00e1demos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#5$2",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "But... we aren't even at the First Temple yet!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "See those scaffolds? This street is a stone's throw from the main entrance to the temple. I'm sure you can find your own way.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hek\u00e1demos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#5$2",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wait\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#7$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Now, if you'll excuse me, I have a drinking engagement with a friend. He'll kill me if I'm late. Goodbye.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hek\u00e1demos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
