    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1482_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mio"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#1$2",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "You know, I was worried that the Astynomos' Grammate\u00fas would just take me around to see mundane tourist sites, leaving me with nothing to talk about when we get back.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1482_1#4$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "You've got a way of smoothing things over for people, you know that?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mio"
    },
    {
        "text": "If you ask me, I think the deferential-looking Liberi kid just enjoyed a three-hour break!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mio"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#1$2",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Well, no need to complain. There's plenty of time. Let's check out the surrounding area.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#9$2",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "This is the land of heroes, after all. Maybe we'll walk out the door and straight into a heroic epic!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1482_1#4$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "I knew it! You came looking for adventure!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mio"
    },
    {
        "text": "Rats, I came to you when I left the Grand Bazaar because I wanted a sugar mommy with money. Little did I know you were such a troublemaker...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mio"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#9$2",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "posfrom": "0,0",
        "posto": "200,0",
        "afrom": 1,
        "ato": 0,
        "duration": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1482_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey! Wait for me!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mio"
    },
