    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "posfrom": "200,0",
        "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#1$1",
        "posto": "0,0",
        "duration": 1,
        "afrom": 0,
        "ato": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_2069_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Keep your distance.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lykeion"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#7$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's no way to treat your old priest school classmate! I remember you were much more passionate back when we participated in debate competitions at Theros Temple.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hek\u00e1demos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_2069_1#8$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Quiet down already. Loudmouth.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lykeion"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#7$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Looks like you know that I've come to debate you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hek\u00e1demos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't worry, if you lose, I'll sing your defeat through a megaphone in standard hexameter.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hek\u00e1demos"
    },
    {
        "text": "Besides, you're the one who gave me the nickname 'Blaring Megaphone'. In return, I called you\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hek\u00e1demos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$rungeneral"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2074_1#1$1",
        "duration": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Eloquent Rock! Blaring Megaphone!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sober Craftsman"
    },
    {
        "text": "So glad the two great Athenian debaters are here! We're saved!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sober Craftsman"
    },
    {
        "text": "Come with me! The apple farmers are making a scene in the temple, saying that the construction workers are delaying the quarrying to ruin this year's harvest by keeping the apples from sunlight.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sober Craftsman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_2069_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#6$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "What about Pallas? The people may have chosen to build the temple of their own accord, but she was the initial proponent. Why don't you talk to her to resolve your disputes?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hek\u00e1demos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2074_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Pallas has been crazy busy lately. No one's seen her since last night. Maybe someone else needed her.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sober Craftsman"
    },
    {
        "text": "When people heard about it, they were all excited to emulate the heroes in building the temple, doing as much or as little work anyone had time for.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sober Craftsman"
    },
    {
        "text": "Who could have thought that things would get so chaotic, even delaying the city's move to sunnier climes?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sober Craftsman"
    },
    {
        "text": "Please, find us a solution through debate... or at least find us a loser!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sober Craftsman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_2069_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "I guess the two of us in a room naturally drives people to think of debate...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hek\u00e1demos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_2069_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's why I said\u2014keep your distance, and keep quiet.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lykeion"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#8$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "How was I supposed to know? Just because you're smart doesn't mean you should skip the explanation and go straight to the conclusion!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hek\u00e1demos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Actually, no, that's not right. I DID come to debate you. Everything works out!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hek\u00e1demos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_2069_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lykeion"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm busy.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lykeion"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Always the same excuse after all these years. How on Terra did you win that debate championship with such a bland tongue?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hek\u00e1demos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_2069_1#8$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Thank you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lykeion"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "You won't muddle your way out of this. For years, you've been running before I can finish the word 'debate'. Don't forget that there's still a competition we haven't settled!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hek\u00e1demos"
    },
    {
        "text": "Come on, who are you arguing for? The fruit farmers or the temple workers?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hek\u00e1demos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_2069_1#8$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "You've known me long enough to know that I don't lie.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lykeion"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_2069_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "*sigh*... I'm going to the new Oripathy clinic to get medicine. Can you move?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lykeion"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#11$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "What...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hek\u00e1demos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "posfrom": "0,0",
        "posto": "-200,0",
        "afrom": 1,
        "ato": 0,
        "duration": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#11$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oripathy medicine? Didn't he pick up some last Wednesday...? Is he getting worse?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hek\u00e1demos"
    },
    {
        "text": "I need to find out.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hek\u00e1demos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "posfrom": "0,0",
        "posto": "-200,0",
        "afrom": 1,
        "ato": 0,
        "duration": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2074_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey! Don't go!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sober Craftsman"
    },
    {
        "text": "The fruit farmers and our guys are about to come to blows! Who's gonna solve our problem? We can't just pull some random soul off the street!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sober Craftsman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1482_1#1$1",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#9$2",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#9$2",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Look, Mio! So many people here in the temple! Looks like the Athenians are really excited to rebuild it! I feel like joining in myself!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#1$2",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Excuse me, sir. Are you looking for someone to help?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
